gin{aligned}r(t) & =5(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4t\\,i+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4t\\,j).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe find the velocity and acceleration vectors by differentiating. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =(5(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4t\\,i+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4t\\,j))^{′} \\\\  & =-20\\operatorname{sin}⁡4t\\,i+20\\operatorname{cos}⁡4t\\,j \\\\ a(t) & =(-20\\operatorname{sin}⁡4t\\,i+20\\operatorname{cos}⁡4t\\,j)^{′} \\\\  & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡4t\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡4t\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find the acceleration vector at $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})\\,j \\\\  & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\pi )\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )\\,j \\\\  & =-80\\,i\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-97673/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "17787055-19de-5dca-b1f9-e97a3a7c2aff"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97673"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97672/selection/d6c0eb322543def217e2d5f15f4e2d5443617ea393c8f470127b1d07ce0205fc" :answer/id #uuid "e9ac457c-6532-56c4-8953-9b6f5a8779e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36\\,i" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97672/selection/b9c565895a0d9cff3f93f3c1135db136e3340ee131fd058d715ea523e6af5b73" :answer/id #uuid "ab6ec45d-5880-5f0c-8eb3-bb36a257fd72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-36\\,i+36\\,j" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97672/selection/1551a6ce51ca5155c66092123aad2d47b0f4715532532d9aab6577d6baad5f14" :answer/id #uuid "8207b716-5073-567a-8b5a-f7e65fa4ddbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12\\,i-12\\,j" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97672/selection/a46d34e1cf3fbdf371f0c8023c255da7e7fb0c2fbe01a6ecdd3a96968661a979" :answer/id #uuid "4e55b860-d938-5d37-bd6d-2600eb9a1b1b" 